---
Stop a running game

Usage: easyplay stop [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --force       Force-stop immediately instead of asking the game to close
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
